      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "With variances in texture support I think making a good quality app might be tricky. If unity is given the wrong texture format it will convert on the fly. Using the wrong phone might steer people in wrong direction for formats. \n\nSame risk with shaders of optimizing for a random phone rather then Quest.",
